# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Inquiry form (src/components/InquiryForm.tsx)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Create a form at https://formspree.io, then paste the endpoint it gives you
# below. Until this is set, the form shows the direct email/phone instead of
# silently pretending a submission succeeded.
#
# Local development: copy this file to `.env` and fill it in.
# Vercel: add VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT under
#         Project → Settings → Environment Variables (Production + Preview),
#         then redeploy.
VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
